    "description": "This data set contains plant-wild bee interactions observed during transect walks in calcareous grasslands in Estonia, Germany and Spain. In addition, it contains data on the flower cover of insect-pollinated plant species recorded in the transects. Data were sampled within the InterRest project in 2022 and 2023.",
